  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_1_1
    value: '<size=14><color=#FFFFFF>-    Player bets for each of the 5 reels.

      -    Win the sum total of all value symbols that appear on the reels.

      -    Symbol value range varies according to the player''s bet level.</color></size>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_1_2
    value: <style=title><size=30>LOCK & MERGE RE-SPIN BONUS
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_1_2
    value: "<size=14><color=#FFFFFF>-  4 or more            symbols triggers the Lock
      & Merge Re-Spin Bonus.\n\n-  Additional            symbols awards +1 Spin.\n\n-
      \ All initial            symbols get locked into position, while remaining spots
      spin independently.\n\n-  During the bonus, all additional            symbols
      also get locked in place.\n\n-             symbols adjacent to each other get
      merged then locked in place.\n\n-  Up to 3          symbols, only vertical merging
      happens. For more than 3 adjacent           symbols, they merge to create the
      biggest possible          ,\n in the order of 15, 12, 10, 9, 8, 6, or 4 sizes
      big.\n\n-  Award pay depending on the size of the merged            . Merging
      of 4 or more            tirggers the vertical Wheel Bonus.</color></size>"
